        <h3>The hidden costs of running it yourself</h3>
        <p>A website-builder subscription ($16&ndash;$50 a month, depending on the plan), plus the unpaid hours you or your office manager spend in the editor, the occasional freelance bill for what you can't fix, the revenue lost to the speed and contact gaps above, and the hours that don't go to paying work.</p>
