        <h3>The same line item, at a fraction of the cost</h3>
        <p>Most service-business retainers in this category run $500&ndash;$2,500 a month, plus fees for each change and a design deposit up front. The plan replaces that line item at roughly a third of the median price, with $0 down and no per-change fees.</p>
        <p class="roi-cost-tally"><strong>Total:</strong> 30&ndash;65% less each month, with the design deposit and per-change fees gone.</p>
